============================================================
8. PAYMENT FLOW
============================================================

STUDENT DIRECT PAYMENT:

[ ] Student chooses plan
        ↓
[ ] Checkout
        ↓
[ ] Paystack
        ↓
[ ] Payment successful
        ↓
[ ] Transaction created
        ↓
[ ] Subscription created
        ↓
[ ] Student activated
        ↓
[ ] Confirmation


ADMIN / TEACHER WALLET PAYMENT:

[ ] Admin/Teacher funds wallet
        ↓
[ ] Paystack
        ↓
[ ] Wallet credited
        ↓
[ ] Admin/Teacher selects student
        ↓
[ ] Select plan
        ↓
[ ] Confirm activation
        ↓
[ ] Wallet debited
        ↓
[ ] Subscription activated
        ↓
[ ] Transaction recorded


============================================================
9. REFERRAL FLOW
============================================================

METHOD 1 — REFERRAL LINK

Teacher:

[ ] Generate referral code
[ ] Generate referral link
[ ] Copy link
[ ] Share link

Student:

[ ] Opens referral link
[ ] Registers
[ ] System stores referrer
[ ] Student pays
[ ] Payment successful
[ ] Referral becomes successful
[ ] Commission calculated


METHOD 2 — DIRECT STUDENT CREATION

Teacher/Admin:

[ ] Click Create Student
[ ] Enter student details
[ ] Create account
[ ] System automatically records creator
[ ] Student appears under creator
[ ] Student can be activated


